    text: "Ten ash trees at the stand north-west of Oakwood. The canopy closes over it, so the walking is the hard part, not the cutting. The Canopy Walk goes over the top of the wet ground and wants Agility six. It saves near eighty metres. I do not use it. I am old and I like the ground.",
