    id: "ode_long_cairn_reported",
    text: "Re-stacked. Not fallen, not robbed. Re-stacked, by something with a sense of order and more patience than the living have. ... The nineteen make a line. It runs off terrace four, down both ramps and into the quarry face, and it ends at a hole my neighbours have a rota for. Go and ask Watcher Hale what his rota has actually seen. He will tell you if you ask him plainly.",
